{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日で真夏の全国ツアー2016\n仙台公演が無事に3公演とも終わりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仙台は、春にやったアンダーライブ\n東北シリーズぶりにきて\nゼビオアリーナは1年ぶりでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1年前のゼビオアリーナのステージからみた\n景色とも違うし\n東北シリーズのアンダーライブで\n仙台に来た時とも違う気持ちでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アリーナ席とスタンド席と\nステージと全部が近くて\n一体感のあるゼビオアリーナ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その一体感をもっと感じたくて\n途中からはイヤモニを片方外して\n感じてました('∀`)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかく私はアイスとかき氷を\n食べ過ぎてると思うから\n気をつけなきゃ！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイスとかかき氷食べると\n胃袋のギアもあがっちゃうんだよね。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だれか止めて～～～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/15/3594690/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/15/3594690/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/15/3594690/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仙台が涼しかった～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心地いい気温！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/15/3594690/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の会場から新幹線乗り場まで行くまでの車の中は生田さんが隣でした♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が2期生として加入してから\n今日までの約3年5ヶ月。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までで1番話した1日でした！(｡・・｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや1日っていうか、\n何分間でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同い年で先輩で\n2次審査の時に憧れてるメンバーは？\nっていう質疑応答に\n生田絵梨花さんです！って答えたのが\n懐かしく感じます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"深川さんが卒業されてから\n車の中のパートナーがいないと\n言ってたので\n車の中のパートナーになれるように\nトーク力を磨かなければ！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかく、たくさん笑って楽しかったっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/15/3594690/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/15/3594690/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ボーダーが同じだった(｡・・｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"通路挟んで隣にスタッフさんが\n座ったんだけど\nスタッフさんもボーダーだった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/15/3594690/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなんちゃんも一緒に♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/15/3594690/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週1週間がんばるぞ～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"環境の変化が苦手です！\nでも、その変化は必ず起きてしまうもので\nどうにもできないです！\nだから、環境の変化が嫌でも起こるなら\n私も変化します！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その変化以上の変化を起こしてやる(｡-_-｡)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、今日はこの辺で！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい！"}],"source":"archive"}